        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "2d9c72b1-83d7-5395-9129-f184bbae2fd8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jon Heder, Jaclyn Hales, Rob Schneider, David Spade, Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Cheryl Hines, Gary Cole, Roy Disney\n- Films and Series: Napoleon Dynamite, The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, Walt Before Mickey, Monster House, Surf's Up, Christmas Eve, Scents and Sensibility, Unicorn City, Alienate, Napoleon Dynamite animated series\n- Companies: Revolution Studios, Happy Madison Productions, Columbia Pictures\n- Roles: actor, producer, voice actor\n\nFacts:\n- Jon Heder was born on October 26, 1977, and he is an American actor and producer.\n- Jon Heder made his feature film debut in 2004 as the title character in the comedy film \"Napoleon Dynamite.\"\n- Jon Heder starred in \"The Benchwarmers\" alongside Rob Schneider and David Spade.\n- \"The Benchwarmers\" was produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and was distributed by Columbia Pictures.\n- Jon Heder acted in the films \"School for Scoundrels,\" \"Blades of Glory,\" \"Mama's Boy,\" \"When in Rome,\" and \"Walt Before Mickey,\" in which he played Roy Disney.\n- Jon Heder provided voice talent in the animated films \"Monster House\" and \"Surf's Up,\" and in the \"Napoleon Dynamite\" animated series.\n- Jaclyn Hales was born on September 4, 1986, and she is an American actress.\n- Jaclyn Hales is known for acting in \"Scents and Sensibility\" (2011), \"Unicorn City\" (2012), \"Christmas Eve\" (2015), and \"Alienate\" (2016).\n- The 2015 film \"Christmas Eve\" features an ensemble cast led by Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Jon Heder, Cheryl Hines, and Gary Cole.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
