        "text": "Page: Jon Heder. Sentence: Jonathan Joseph \"Jon\" Heder ( ) (born October 26, 1977) is an American actor and producer.\nPage: Jon Heder. Sentence: His feature film debut came in 2004 as the title character of the comedy film \"Napoleon Dynamite\".\nPage: Jon Heder. Sentence: He has also acted in the films \"The Benchwarmers\", \"School for Scoundrels\", \"Blades of Glory\", \"Mama's Boy\", \"When in Rome\", and \"Walt Before Mickey\" as Roy Disney, and provided voice talents in the animated films \"Monster House\" and \"Surf's Up\", as well as the \"Napoleon Dynamite\" animated series.\nPage: The Benchwarmers. Sentence: It stars Rob Schneider, David Spade, and Jon Heder.\nPage: The Benchwarmers. Sentence: It is produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and is distributed by Columbia Pictures.\nPage: Christmas Eve (2015 film). Sentence: The film features a large ensemble cast led by Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Jon Heder, Cheryl Hines, and Gary Cole.\nPage: Jaclyn Hales. Sentence: Jaclyn Hales (born September 4, 1986) is an American actress known for acting in \"Scents and Sensibility\" (2011), \"Unicorn City\" (2012), \"Christmas Eve\" (2015) and \"Alienate\" (2016).",
